==Battleground==
*2 [[Gobble]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>.
*1 [[CyberFace]] spawns as the boss after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*3 [[Zuche]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*5 [[Haterbaa 2.0]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*2 [[CyberFace]]s spawn after 43.33 seconds<sup>1,300f</sup>, delay 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
With the appearance of CyberFace, it is important to bring a [[Wave Shield]] unit in order to prevent your units from being destroyed by their Wave. It's recommended to use [[Mightycat (Rare Cat)|Supercat]] to do that as his fast speed allows him get to CyberFace before he attacks. Using [[Catornado (Super Rare Cat)|Catyphoon]] to crit the CyberFaces and HaterBaa 2.0s is a good idea as its fast attack rate can kill them before it gets too bad. For the Gobbles, it is recommended to use units with [[Immune to Toxic|Toxic Immunity]] such as a [[Talents|Talented]] [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Cyborg Cat]] will do and [[Teacher BearCat (Rare Cat)|Cadaver BearCat]] will eliminate the Zuches. [[Million-Dollar Cat (Special Cat)|Million-Dollar Cat]] is actually surprisingly useful here, as at Lv.46+, they can one-shot the initial CyberFace and give you Extra Money in the process.

